    "intro_narrative": "You are a private investigator who has broken into the abandoned office of a notorious white-collar criminal. He managed to siphon millions into an offshore account before disappearing into the night. You've locked down the building, but the automated server wipe will commence in exactly one hour. To trace the stolen funds and recover the money, you must explore the office, find his hidden clues, and navigate through a web of sophisticated security protocols. The ultimate goal is to validate the hidden bank account and authorize the return transfer before all evidence is erased forever.",
